<title>USA: Auburn, Ala., won by Regions Investment Co.</title>
<headline>Auburn, Ala., won by Regions Investment Co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regions Investment Company, formerly First Alabama Bank, said it won $11 million of Auburn, Ala., general obligation capital improvement school warrants, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.5494 percent.</p>
</text>
